{"code":"225590","name":"패션플랫폼","market":"KOSDAQ","sector_name":"섬유,의류,신발,호화품","sector_desc":"의류·신발 제조(OEM 포함)와 브랜드. 소비 경기와 해외 바이어 주문, 환율에 영향을 받습니다.","desc":"동사는 2009년 여성의류 제조 및 판매를 목적으로 설립됨. 2018년 합병을 통해 코스닥에 상장되었으며, 사업 확장 및 주주가치 극대화를 위해 진행함. 연결대상 종속기업으로 데코앤에프를 보유하고 있음. '더레노마', '보니스팍스', '데코', '르샵블랑', '리에떼' 등 5개 브랜드를 보유하고 있음. 백화점, 아울렛, 대리점 등 오프라인 유통망을 통해 제품 판매를 진행하고 있음.","f":{"date":"2026-10-23","n_days":300,"close":2980.0,"open":2940.0,"high":3145.0,"low":2940.0,"volume":13638,"amount":40641240.0,"ret_1d":-2.6144,"gap":-3.9216,"range_pct":6.8792,"ret_5":-4.7923,"ret_20":-8.7289,"ret_60":-6.7293,"ret_120":-37.5262,"ret_250":-32.1957,"ma20":3047.0,"ma60":3087.4167,"ma120":3517.125,"ma200":3861.625,"close_vs_ma200":-22.8304,"close_vs_ma60":-3.4792,"ma_align":0,"cross_ma200_20d":0.0,"slope_60":17.4276,"r2_60":0.0428,"slope_120":-62.3748,"r2_120":0.6876,"slope_250":-36.7864,"r2_250":0.6423,"high52":4835.0,"low52":2600.0,"pos_52w":17.0022,"dd_52w":-38.3661,"mdd_1y":-44.0042,"atr14_pct":6.22,"vol_ann_60":58.0689,"vol_avg20":27179.85,"vol_ratio20":0.5018,"vr5":0.2962,"vr20":0.9732,"amount_avg5":37818308.0,"amount_avg20":82987214.75,"amount_avg60":124400951.1667,"obv_chg20":-32.7732,"turnover_20":10.6143,"pv_eff_20":-0.8224,"rsi14":44.0904,"frgn_net_5":-6206.0,"inst_net_5":0.0,"frgn_net_5_pct":-0.1212,"inst_net_5_pct":0.0,"smart_net_5_pct":-0.1212,"frgn_net_20":-3298.0,"inst_net_20":0.0,"frgn_net_20_pct":-0.0644,"inst_net_20_pct":0.0,"smart_net_20_pct":-0.0644,"frgn_net_60":126572.0,"inst_net_60":-2.0,"frgn_net_60_pct":2.4714,"inst_net_60_pct":-0.0,"smart_net_60_pct":2.4714,"frgn_net_120":178777.0,"inst_net_120":43994.0,"frgn_net_120_pct":3.4908,"inst_net_120_pct":0.859,"smart_net_120_pct":4.3498,"foreign_ratio":4.41,"foreign_ratio_chg_60":2.29,"smart_buy_streak":0,"op_income_q":42.0,"op_margin_q":13.9073,"op_qoq":31.25,"op_turnaround":0.0,"op_yoy":366.6667,"rev_yoy":13.1086,"op_trend_4q":19.3939,"fin_period":"202606","roe":13.23,"debt_ratio":29.43,"per":1.4,"pbr":0.18,"div